         "marks": [],
         "type": "text",
         "text": "A siren on a vehicle emits sound of frequency 600 Hz. The vehicle moves at 40.0 m s⁻¹ directly towards a stationary observer. The speed of sound in air is 340 m s⁻¹."
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "marks": [],
         "type": "text",
         "text": "What is the frequency of the sound heard by the observer?"
